{"unit_id":"jelech__dsh-im-gateway#card-zh","repo":"jelech/dsh-im-gateway","commit":"684a93961c7fbedf10b787b48e44190a074da967","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-im-gateway 是一款面向 DSH 网页端的微信消息接入插件。它在 DSH host 注册 IM 网关服务和 WeChat iLink 通道，并可提供浏览器设置面板用于扫码登录、查看状态和测试 agent 回复。插件按微信联系人建立独立的 agent 会话，支持普通文本对话、查看会话列表、开启新会话、查询状态及切换模型。适合希望在微信中继续与 DSH agent 对话并管理会话的用户。使用前需要微信账号扫码登录；消息通过微信 iLink 服务收发。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:24-37","client.js:89-96","lib/gateway.js:109-129","lib/commands.js:18-29"]}
{"unit_id":"jelech__dsh-im-gateway#card-en","repo":"jelech/dsh-im-gateway","commit":"684a93961c7fbedf10b787b48e44190a074da967","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-im-gateway connects WeChat messages to DSH agent sessions. It registers a host gateway and optional browser panel for QR login and status. Contacts get separate text conversations; chat commands start or list sessions, show status, and switch models. A WeChat account is needed to log in.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:24-37","client.js:89-96","lib/gateway.js:109-129","lib/commands.js:18-29"]}
